 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 President Trump and Thai Prime Minister Anutin Charnvirakul with a signed trade deal today in Manila, Philippines. Photo: Carlos Barria/Reuters 🇵🇭 President Trump arrived in the Philippines, where he met with regional partners, sought to formalize a trade deal, and got a break from a series of setbacks at home — including major flight disruptions. Trump will fly to China tomorrow for historic nuclear talks on Thursday with Chinese President Xi Jinping and Russian President Vladimir Putin. Go deeper . 🦠 The U.S. has lost its measles-free status, as the highly contagious virus has spread at the highest rate in more than 30 years — largely among unvaccinated people. Go deeper . 🏛️ House Minority Leader Hakeem Jeffries (D-N.Y.) plans to force his members to take a tallied vote this week on whether to nominate him as Speaker of the House. The plan marks a shift in tactics that would help reveal whether he has the votes to become Speaker on Jan. 3. More from Axios' Andrew Solender . 
 
